        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wade Watts, Thurgood Marshall, Martin Luther King Jr., Miller Newman, J. C. Watts\n- Organizations: NAACP, Oklahoma Sooners, Canadian Football League\n- Topics: American civil rights movement, American politics, college football, professional football\n\nFacts:\n- During the American civil rights movement, Wade Watts worked with Thurgood Marshall and developed a friendship with Martin Luther King Jr.\n- Wade Watts has been cited as a mentor by Miller Newman, the current leader of the NAACP in Oklahoma, and by his nephew, former congressman J. C. Watts.\n- J. C. Watts Jr. was born on November 18, 1957.\n- J. C. Watts Jr. is an American politician from Oklahoma.\n- J. C. Watts Jr. was a college football quarterback for the Oklahoma Sooners and later played professionally in the Canadian Football League.",
